            {
                "entry_id": "a439a207-f2bf-360c-b036-6babfe2f9e2f",
                "word": "réduflation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a486fb61-5b97-4435-a16e-31ae6de4aa44",
                        "entry_id": "a439a207-f2bf-360c-b036-6babfe2f9e2f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "réduflations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dd5e66f9-053a-3387-ac15-1df91c2ed337",
                        "entry_id": "a439a207-f2bf-360c-b036-6babfe2f9e2f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Type d’inflation résultant d’une augmentation indirecte du prix d’achat d’un bien par la réduction de la quantité maintenant offerte au même prix qu’avant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2f8e3c6-ca7f-498c-badb-ac8267a66bc1",
                                "sense_id": "dd5e66f9-053a-3387-ac15-1df91c2ed337",
                                "text": "La réduflation est une façon pour les manufacturiers de mieux faire avaler la pilule aux consommateurs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d1f2d07-33b5-4cf8-9560-5c0904ab5dd1",
                                "sense_id": "dd5e66f9-053a-3387-ac15-1df91c2ed337",
                                "text": "Protégez-vous avait fait une analyse similaire en 2016 et en 2019, ce qui a permis à l’équipe du magazine d’identifier une autre tendance à la hausse : la « réduflation ».\nDans 13 % des cas, le produit a réduit de taille — par exemple tous les fromages sont passés de 460 g à 400 g — et se vend au même prix, voire plus cher."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5a6d104-4d92-43f3-8a30-015f8f235e87",
                        "source_entry_id": "a439a207-f2bf-360c-b036-6babfe2f9e2f",
                        "source_sense_id": "dd5e66f9-053a-3387-ac15-1df91c2ed337",
                        "target_lang_word": "Shrinkflation",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Shrinkflation",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8047419a-2ccb-3657-81e7-b024c73b540e",
                                        "entry_id": "780993ff-3877-3df6-aef9-8b049af39502",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Verkleinern der Portionierungsgrößen von Verbrauchsgütern oder das Abfüllen einer geringeren Menge, um Inflation zu verbergen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c71b78bd-8d1c-439c-96c7-82fb949a0c04",
                                                "sense_id": "8047419a-2ccb-3657-81e7-b024c73b540e",
                                                "text": "Eine Seifenverpackung hat durch Shrinkflation 10 % weniger Inhalt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "482147f6-5a45-48cc-a14c-2165062266fe",
                                                "sense_id": "8047419a-2ccb-3657-81e7-b024c73b540e",
                                                "text": "„Dort gesellt sich zu den steigenden Preisen nun aber noch ein Phänomen: Shrinkflation – also kleinere Verpackungen bei gleichem oder höherem Preis.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aed720cd-2234-45bb-92be-a98d6cfb95cd",
                        "source_entry_id": "a439a207-f2bf-360c-b036-6babfe2f9e2f",
                        "source_sense_id": "dd5e66f9-053a-3387-ac15-1df91c2ed337",
                        "target_lang_word": "shrinkflation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "shrinkflation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e933734d-fd7b-38d5-a337-7666965f3ff1",
                                        "entry_id": "8a4fd24b-dd16-3f25-bef4-9b0cef4eeb59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The practice of making products smaller while continuing to market them at the same price."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "neologism",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d05d07c7-8ae3-4fe7-b7dd-08da1a553677",
                                                "sense_id": "e933734d-fd7b-38d5-a337-7666965f3ff1",
                                                "text": "Chocolate bars are just the thin end of the wedge, though, and shrinkflation is happening in products right across the board."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "262442cd-dcf5-45d6-822a-2e73648df340",
                                                "sense_id": "e933734d-fd7b-38d5-a337-7666965f3ff1",
                                                "text": "According to the UK Office for National Statistics (ONS), shrinkflation most commonly affects food, drink and household products such as toilet rolls, nappies, tissues and washing-up liquid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "897febe5-3b0b-4199-ade3-fcae182954eb",
                                                "sense_id": "e933734d-fd7b-38d5-a337-7666965f3ff1",
                                                "text": "Major cereal brand Kelloggs has also been accused of shrinkflation. Since 2019, the company had moved from selling 670 gram Crunchy Nut boxes for $6 to selling 640 gram boxes at $9 a pop, Choice found."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f9dd6a4-d851-48f4-8275-8f34420dfff3",
                                                "sense_id": "e933734d-fd7b-38d5-a337-7666965f3ff1",
                                                "text": "Consumer groups say shrinkflation is a widespread practice, which supermarkets like Carrefour are also guilty of in their own-label products."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
